        "text": "Marty Ellington",
        "text_sha256": "3731aed2d6aa54fed8be9c31533f8142933d6a56f07fa3e821ff04e22f8890d5",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Marty Ellington, M.D., M.P.H",
        "text_sha256": "6bf3f6839d2b92c67895645c8ce8c6c74799f225d0db8ed87b9ca80dc96d540b",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "About Marty Ellington, M.D., M.P.H",
        "text_sha256": "62934bc25f804b9d5f0bfd3333cbd399c5a132d820f5ad3f90e9655ee525c868",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Marty Ellington is a board-certified pediatrician and neonatologist practicing at Lenox Hill Hospital in New York City. He currently serves as Chairman of Pediatrics and Director of Newborn Services at Lenox Hill Hospital. Dr. Ellington received an M.D. as well as an M.P.H. from the University of Michigan in Ann Arbor.",
        "text_sha256": "a639d8d3eeaf6a649f1e0474fc01321465244570c18a87ed9a35699a16e4bfdd",
        "word_count": 52
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Ellington completed his residency at UCSF Department of Pediatrics in San Francisco, California, and a fellowship in newborn medicine at Boston Children’s Hospital and Harvard Medical School.",
        "text_sha256": "4c71f86a630526450b501714760626b3b2d36297cf97aacf4e57d768c5260e09",
        "word_count": 28
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Ellington has been selected as among the best neonatologists in New York City by the New York Times and New York magazine for numerous years.",
        "text_sha256": "8f3c6552c023c134395c6aa94c44a636146365fb4d243bfb4168f68bf48ee58b",
        "word_count": 26
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Board certifications",
        "text_sha256": "b6ebfd0050d34a00e27b7a07eb958e6520d9d8c003bea281b96762ad17883d6b",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Ellington is board-certified by the American Board of Pediatrics.",
        "text_sha256": "a03a98bca1100e8301e08c45d2814982028e27e8c7ec6a7576cd0f1b725b9a94",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Hospital affiliations",
        "text_sha256": "e6504e68d7e8e6b8187bc1b13e33b31f751fb7b365b27cf9f90691053f642ba2",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Ellington is affiliated with Lenox Hill Hospital in New York City.",
        "text_sha256": "b56bb3b181d516dd6dd9399d83b0fc0bd5576efd9bf9572d108fd0726f5e4627",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Other relevant positions",
        "text_sha256": "3cb35bf4b505f1c9652a309bbf062b6c5ebff2ba01239bd968b9ac137f401f2b",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Dr. Ellington is Chairman of Pediatrics and Chairman of the Credentials Committees at Lenox Hill Hospital. He is also an assistant professor at the Donald and Barbara Zucker School of Medicine at Hofstra/Northwell in Hempstead, New York.",
        "text_sha256": "181dd30e53a7a20234df644afcbabe4ed04b1a90eb81131f28202ca0c35eaeca",
        "word_count": 37
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The educational health content on What To Expect is reviewed by our medical review board and team of experts to be up-to-date and in line with the latest evidence-based medical information and accepted health guidelines, including the medically reviewed What to Expect books by Heidi Murkoff. This educational content is not medical or diagnostic advice. Use of this site is subject to our terms of use and privacy policy . © 2005-2026 Everyday Health, Inc., a Ziff Davis company.",
        "text_sha256": "c423e7e136e9c8ebf39e668c5b1617d92d49cbd07ce74c8b1ec308c597fa3593",
        "word_count": 79
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Opens a new window",
        "text_sha256": "52b71e1a64c4aa4703a246e34de17b242088e4863ab032b365c12e07d7964633",
        "word_count": 4
      }
    ],
